        "title": "Step 6 — Stage 1 Leak libc",
        "content": "We build fake context for:\n- `RIP = puts@plt`\n- `RDI = puts@got`\n\nThen return to `operation_status`, parse leak, and compute:\n- `libc_base = leaked_puts - libc.sym['puts']`"
