    "problemDescription": "**Event:** RAM CTF  \n**Category:** Crypto  \n**Difficulty:** Medium / Hard  \n**Flag:** `RAM{1_10V3_M47r1C35_P13453_D0N7_F1r3_M3}`\n\n---",
